Portions of this directory are adapted from NousResearch/hermes-agent
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent), MIT-licensed.

Specifically:
  - text_utils.py     — UTF-16 length + truncation, adapted from
                        gateway/platforms/base.py (utf16_len, _prefix_within_utf16_limit).
  - streamer.py       — edit-in-place streaming policy and adaptive-backoff
                        idea, adapted from gateway/stream_consumer.py and
                        gateway/platforms/telegram.py.
  - _common/stream_buffer.py — flush-policy fields (interval, threshold,
                               force_size, backoff factor / cap) modelled on
                               StreamConsumerConfig.

The agent loop, model layer, in-process approval resolver, voice STT, model
picker UI, and fallback-IP transport are NOT used in this port — our agent
sits behind FastAPI + SSE rather than running in the same process.

